Can You Exercise During a Heavy Period? Tips for Comfortable Movement

A heavy period does not automatically mean you have to stop exercising. Your comfort and energy levels should guide your activity, especially on days when your menstrual flow is heavier.

Listen to Your Body

Some people feel comfortable exercising during their period, while others prefer lighter activities or additional rest.

There is no need to force yourself through intense exercise if you feel uncomfortable.

Choose the Right Menstrual Protection

If you plan to exercise during a heavy-flow day, choose protection that fits securely and provides coverage appropriate for your flow.

